 "description": "ntfy (notifications-stack VM, container ntfy) on ClickHouse. Original dashboard: every panel used ntfy_* / go_* / process_* metrics from the ntfy :9090 /metrics scrape (job=ntfy) \u2014 ClickHouse has zero ntfy_* rows (7d) and Prometheus has zero ntfy_* series and no job=ntfy (7d, checked 2026-10-13), although ansible/playbooks/notifications_stack/site.yml still configures that scrape on the VM collector; it is not reaching either store. 23 original panels (35 targets) therefore removed as dead. Replacement: ntfy Server stats log lines (published/cached/visitors/users/topics/subscribers, emails) parsed from otel_logs, plus podman container CPU/memory for the ntfy containers. Panels with no live equivalent at all: Messages published (per second), HTTP requests/errors, Attachments, Firebase, UnifiedPush, Matrix messages, Message publish duration, Go routines, File descriptors, Resident/virtual memory. Restore them ported to ntfy_* in otel_metrics_* once the scrape lands.",
